Development 2.4.0 / native ABI epoch 5 (validation in progress)
====================================================================

- Start a deliberate rebuilt native cohort: libXm, libMrm and libUil use
  libtool 5:0:0. Header/runtime epoch checks accompany changed widget/source
  records. No compatibility alias to the preceding SONAME is provided.
- Validate XIM preedit spans, resulting lengths, conversion and caret bounds
  before replacing composition buffers.
- Add ICU scalar/grapheme coordinate maps without changing source-scan scalar
  counting. Share ICU paragraph bidi and HarfBuzz line captures across text
  drawing, metrics, carets, hits, selections and wrapped composition.
- Add native semantic providers and optional AT-SPI D-Bus transport with
  explicit ownership, bounded text ranges and multiple-shell support.
- Add focused fork documentation and source-pinned strict documentation CI.
  Source availability, focused fixtures and installed-cohort acceptance remain
  separate; see docs/status.md for the current validation boundaries.
